rakkan-node embeds a Yggdrasil node (package internal/ygg). The binary links:

  yggdrasil-go v0.5.15   https://github.com/yggdrasil-network/yggdrasil-go
      LGPL-3.0 with a static-linking exception (licenses/LGPL-3.0-yggdrasil-go.txt;
      the LGPL builds on the GPL, licenses/GPL-3.0.txt)
  ironwood               https://github.com/Arceliar/ironwood
      (v0.0.0-20261023231900-0712eccbb962), MPL-2.0 (licenses/MPL-2.0.txt)
  phony                  https://github.com/Arceliar/phony
      (v0.0.0-20220903101357-530938a4b13d), MPL-2.0 (licenses/MPL-2.0.txt)

None of them is modified. Their source code is at the addresses above, at the
versions given, and in the Go module proxy (https://proxy.golang.org).
